  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】世界遺産・平泉＆一関の中尊寺金色堂近くおすすめ名宿比較！平泉倶楽部・しづか亭・武蔵坊</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-rose-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🏯 奥州藤原氏の仏国土「平泉」を早朝参拝で味わう贅沢</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">国宝・中尊寺金色堂や特別名勝・毛越寺の浄土庭園。日中の観光客で賑わう前の静寂に包まれた朝の境内を歩けるのは平泉泊ならではの特権。岩手が誇る最高峰ブランド牛「前沢牛」や一関の伝統「もち本膳料理」を堪能できます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 平泉・一関エリアで後悔しない厳選宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">平泉倶楽部～ｆａｒｍ＆ｒｅｓｏｒｔ～</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.5</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/167834/167834.jpg\" alt=\"平泉倶楽部～ｆａｒｍ＆ｒｅｓｏｒｔ～ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 1日1組限定の築150年古民家リゾート！南部鉄器風呂と専属シェフの前沢牛ディナー</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">広大な田園風景の中に佇む一棟貸切のラグジュアリー古民家。伝統の気仙大工による木組み建築、プライベートな南部鉄器風呂、地元専属シェフが目の前で調理する前沢牛コースが至高の体験。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>記念日、三世代ファミリー、プライベートな最高級ステイを求める人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>1日1組限定の贅沢な古民家リゾートと極上前沢牛ディナーなら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D167834\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】平泉倶楽部～ｆａｒｍ＆ｒｅｓｏｒｔ～ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">奥州平泉温泉　そば庵　しづか亭</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.23</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/54928/54928.jpg\" alt=\"奥州平泉温泉　そば庵　しづか亭 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 自家栽培の手打ち十割そばと源泉掛け流し美肌温泉！静寂の里山に佇む一軒宿</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">平泉ののどかな山あいに建つ隠れ宿。とろとろの美肌天然温泉に浸かった後は、毎朝手打ちする風味豊かな十割そばと前沢牛のすき焼き・陶板焼きに舌鼓を打てます。</p>\n  \